+Display directory trees in the terminal with clean formatting.
 
 ## Features
 
 - Recursive directory listing with tree formatting
-- Depth limiting (`-L`)
-- Hidden file toggle (`-a`)
-- File size display (`-s`)
-- Symlink detection with target display
-- Color output by file type (dirs, executables, images, code, archives)
-- Ignore patterns via CLI or `.gitignore`/`.treeignore` files
-- Include/exclude glob filters (`-I`, `-x`)
-- Output to file (`-o`)
-- Summary with directory and file counts
+- Unicode box-drawing characters (├──, └──, │)
