+	Long: `process-tree shows running processes in a hierarchical tree format.
+
+Reads from /proc to build a process tree showing parent-child relationships,
+with CPU and memory usage for each process.
+
+Examples:
+  process-tree
+  process-tree --pid 1234
+  process-tree search nginx
+  process-tree stats`,
+	Version: version,
+}
+
+func Execute() error {
+	return rootCmd.Execute()
