+# validate-api
+
+REST API for validating emails, phone numbers, CPF, and CNPJ.
+
+## Endpoints
+
+| Method | Path | Description |
+|--------|------|-------------|
+| GET | `/health` | Health check |
+| POST | `/api/validate/email` | Validate email address |
+| POST | `/api/validate/phone` | Validate phone number |
+| POST | `/api/validate/cpf` | Validate Brazilian CPF |
